        "created_at": "2024-04-22T14:05:50.095Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chief_Lackey_Rich\" data-post=\"19\" data-topic=\"30746\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chief_Lackey_Rich:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Surely the more appropriate phrase would be “…he was stuck on her…” wouldn’t it?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There was a joke about him telling Brianna that something about him “sticks with you”, with the follow-up joke being that she didn’t know he was the Adhesivist yet so he had to add “hang on to that, it’ll make sense later”.</p>",
